 engines or x2t; full editor source correspondence remains unverified.
 
 [AGPL-3.0](LICENSE)
+
+### Save completion across the host boundary
+
+The paired parent library and host use `onlyoffice-browser-host/v2`. `SAVE_ACK` confirms persistence of the returned artifact; `SAVE_COMPLETE` is emitted only after native save state and the host request owner have been released. The public `save()` promise waits for both stages, including failure cleanup. Deploy the parent library and host together; a v1 host is not compatible with this completion contract.
